    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life got you in a pickle? Are you always hanging on \u2019til fry-day? Got beef?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burger Bois is a food truck simulator game about flavor, not labor. Play as Patty, the accidental owner of a failing bespoke burger business, and launch your new career as the owner-operator of a designer burger truck. Get the vibe for each customer, and design unique sandwiches from start to finish, crafting your customers\u2019 most vague requests into culinary masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Dream Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/38a34b043e38d68e0070bd2fbcea1d90.poster.avif?t=1753307384\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/38a34b043e38d68e0070bd2fbcea1d90.webm?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/38a34b043e38d68e0070bd2fbcea1d90.mp4?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menu? No problem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will tell you the <strong>flavors, properties, and restrictions</strong>\u00a0that you have to work with. It\u2019s your job to create a bespoke burger that speaks to their stomach and soul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf54 Dish Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/2cb66c01b219a59cd5fd8660acd184fc.poster.avif?t=1753307384\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/2cb66c01b219a59cd5fd8660acd184fc.webm?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/2cb66c01b219a59cd5fd8660acd184fc.mp4?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers will pay based on how well you satisfied their cravings. Don\u2019t mess it up too badly, or you might not recoup your costs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form relationships with regular customers and follow their stories as you serve up burgers that make or break their days. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude9a Park Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/1456f260c5962656692f1b68eec82f77.poster.avif?t=1753307384\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/1456f260c5962656692f1b68eec82f77.webm?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/1456f260c5962656692f1b68eec82f77.mp4?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire exciting new ingredients, promote your small business, and impress your customers to maximize your reputation on Welp. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your burger business moves up the rankings, unlock new supplier contracts and more lucrative parking spots. Take your burger truck from a dingy parking lot to a beachside boardwalk to a less dingy parking lot - sticking it to your Corporate Hospitality Business RivalTM, collecting hidden #FoodPics, and meeting new delightfully weird customers along the way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Burger Bois is a love letter to food and hospitality, with nods to many of our favorite games. We wanted to combine the food service of <strong>Good Pizza, Great Pizza</strong>, with the creative challenge of <strong>Sticky Business</strong>, and the quirky, comedic characters of <strong>Ace Attorney</strong>.\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food prep is out. Flavor design is in.</strong> Consider the real-world properties and flavors of ingredients to design uniquely satisfying burgers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who needs a menu anyway?</strong> Interpret increasingly vague requests to try and impress your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let\u2019s get experimental.</strong> Play with your food to collect over 20 elusive #FoodPic illustrations, lovingly crafted by indie artists like @sharkeesart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We\u2019re all weird here.</strong> Get to know a cast of relatably weird friends, enemies, and customers (who are sometimes also enemies).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightheartedly cutthroat competition.</strong> Manage your truck and boost your reputation to score the hottest parking spots in town and show your rival who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flavor made real.</strong> Share your creations with friends\u2014and even export the recipes so you can taste-test for yourself.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life got you in a pickle? Are you always hanging on \u2019til fry-day? Got beef?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burger Bois is a food truck simulator game about flavor, not labor. Play as Patty, the accidental owner of a failing bespoke burger business, and launch your new career as the owner-operator of a designer burger truck. Get the vibe for each customer, and design unique sandwiches from start to finish, crafting your customers\u2019 most vague requests into culinary masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Dream Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/38a34b043e38d68e0070bd2fbcea1d90.poster.avif?t=1753307384\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/38a34b043e38d68e0070bd2fbcea1d90.webm?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/38a34b043e38d68e0070bd2fbcea1d90.mp4?t=1753307384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menu? No problem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will tell you the <strong>flavors, properties, and restrictions</strong>\u00a0that you have to work with. It\u2019s your job to create a bespoke burger that speaks to their stomach and soul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf54 Dish Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224290/extras/2cb66c01b219a59cd5fd8660acd184fc.poster.avif?t=1753307384\" width=600 height=220 