\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Burger Bois is a love letter to food and hospitality, with nods to many of our favorite games. We wanted to combine the food service of <strong>Good Pizza, Great Pizza</strong>, with the creative challenge of <strong>Sticky Business</strong>, and the quirky, comedic characters of <strong>Ace Attorney</strong>.\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food prep is out. Flavor design is in.</strong> Consider the real-world properties and flavors of ingredients to design uniquely satisfying burgers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who needs a menu anyway?</strong> Interpret increasingly vague requests to try and impress your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let\u2019s get experimental.</strong> Play with your food to collect over 20 elusive #FoodPic illustrations, lovingly crafted by indie artists like @sharkeesart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We\u2019re all weird here.</strong> Get to know a cast of relatably weird friends, enemies, and customers (who are sometimes also enemies).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightheartedly cutthroat competition.</strong> Manage your truck and boost your reputation to score the hottest parking spots in town and show your rival who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flavor made real.</strong> Share your creations with friends\u2014and even export the recipes so you can taste-test for yourself.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A food truck simulator about flavor, not labor. As chief burger creative, design perfect sandwiches and craft your customers\u2019 most vague requests into culinary masterpieces - or disasterpieces! No recipe, no 'one-right-answer': just let your tastebuds take you to the top.",
